        "id": "textbook-unit-intro",
        "moduleId": "unit-positioning",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材给出的定位",
        "markdown": "第 2.3 单元的标题是「LangGraph 框架」。教材把这一站的任务说得很直接：学习如何使用 LangGraph 框架来构建应用程序，而该框架能帮助我们**组织和编排复杂的 LLM 工作流**。\n\n紧接着教材给出了更凝练的一句定义：LangGraph 是一个通过提供对智能体流程的**控制**工具，帮助构建**生产就绪**应用程序的框架。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-7292b904174cec3c19c934e3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000157"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 2.3 单元. LangGraph 框架"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4509,
              "lineEnd": 4510,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "e2e42d4d62acc5beda5d02cf189509b9579f4eb5ee3d05bc9c2ad53efc53e770"
            },
            {
              "materialId": "doc-7292b904174cec3c19c934e3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000158"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 2.3 单元. LangGraph 框架",
                "欢迎来到 `LangGraph` 的世界"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4511,
              "lineEnd": 4521,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://huggingface.co/datasets/agents-course/course-images/resolve/main/en/unit2/LangGraph/LangGraph.png"
